<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="DevOps Multi-Tier AWS Architecture Challenge">
  <title>DevOps | AWS Multi-Tier Architecture</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #07111f;
      --surface: #0d1b2d;
      --surface-2: #12243a;
      --border: #25405e;
      --text: #e8f0f8;
      --muted: #91a5ba;
      --blue: #4da3ff;
      --cyan: #44d9e6;
      --green: #49d17d;
      --orange: #ffb454;
      --purple: #a98bff;
      --shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.28);
      --radius: 18px;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,
                   "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 10% 0%, rgba(77,163,255,.12), transparent 28%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 90% 15%, rgba(68,217,230,.08), transparent 25%),
        var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }

    .container {
      width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 40px));
      margin: auto;
    }

    header {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 10;
      background: rgba(7,17,31,.86);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(37,64,94,.7);
    }

    nav {
      min-height: 68px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -.02em;
    }

    .brand-mark {
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      border-radius: 11px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--blue), var(--cyan));
      color: #03101d;
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 22px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .92rem;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--text); }

    .hero {
      padding: 90px 0 65px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr .8fr;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 55px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 7px 11px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 999px;
      color: var(--cyan);
      background: rgba(68,217,230,.06);
      font-size: .78rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .08em;
    }

    h1 {
      margin-top: 20px;
      font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 6vw, 5rem);
      line-height: .98;
      letter-spacing: -.055em;
    }

    .gradient {
      background: linear-gradient(100deg, var(--blue), var(--cyan));
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      background-clip: text;
      color: transparent;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 680px;
      margin-top: 24px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    .buttons {
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 30px;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 12px 17px;
      border-radius: 11px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: .9rem;
      transition: .2s ease;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--blue), #2f7fe0);
      border-color: transparent;
      color: white;
    }

    .btn-secondary { color: var(--muted); }
    .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }

    .hero-card {
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(18,36,58,.92), rgba(13,27,45,.92));
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 24px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .terminal {
      background: #050b13;
      border: 1px solid #1d3045;
      border-radius: 14px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .terminal-top {
      padding: 10px 14px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #1d3045;
      color: #71869c;
      font-size: .75rem;
    }

    .terminal-body {
      padding: 18px;
      font-family: "SFMono-Regular", Consolas, monospace;
      font-size: .78rem;
      color: #a9bdd0;
    }

    .green { color: var(--green); }
    .blue { color: var(--blue); }
    .orange { color: var(--orange); }

    section { padding: 70px 0; }

    .section-heading {
      margin-bottom: 34px;
    }

    .section-heading span {
      color: var(--cyan);
      font-size: .78rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .12em;
    }

    .section-heading h2 {
      margin-top: 7px;
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
      letter-spacing: -.04em;
    }

    .section-heading p {
      margin-top: 9px;
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 760px;
    }

    .architecture {
      display: grid;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .tier {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: rgba(13,27,45,.72);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 22px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 150px 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .tier-label {
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      min-height: 100px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: .04em;
    }

    .tier-web .tier-label { color: var(--blue); background: rgba(77,163,255,.08); }
    .tier-app .tier-label { color: var(--green); background: rgba(73,209,125,.08); }
    .tier-state .tier-label { color: var(--orange); background: rgba(255,180,84,.08); }

    .tier h3 { font-size: 1.15rem; }
    .tier p { color: var(--muted); font-size: .9rem; margin-top: 5px; }

    .chips {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 13px;
    }

    .chip {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 5px 9px;
      color: #b9c9d9;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.025);
      font-size: .72rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .flow {
      text-align: center;
      color: #607993;
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      height: 18px;
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .card {
      background: rgba(13,27,45,.72);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 23px;
    }

    .card-icon {
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: rgba(77,163,255,.09);
      color: var(--blue);
      font-weight: 900;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .card h3 { font-size: 1.05rem; }
    .card p { margin-top: 8px; color: var(--muted); font-size: .88rem; }

    .steps {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .step {
      position: relative;
      padding: 19px;
      min-height: 170px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: rgba(13,27,45,.7);
      border-radius: 15px;
    }

    .step-number {
      font-family: monospace;
      color: var(--cyan);
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: .78rem;
    }

    .step h3 { margin-top: 15px; font-size: .98rem; }
    .step p { margin-top: 7px; color: var(--muted); font-size: .78rem; }

    .checklist {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .check {
      padding: 15px 17px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 13px;
      background: rgba(13,27,45,.6);
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .check-mark {
      color: var(--green);
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .check strong { font-size: .88rem; }
    .check small { display: block; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 3px; }

    .code {
      background: #050b13;
      border: 1px solid #1d3045;
      border-radius: 15px;
      padding: 20px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      color: #b7c8d8;
      font: .78rem/1.7 "SFMono-Regular", Consolas, monospace;
    }

    footer {
      padding: 35px 0 50px;
      color: #71869c;
      font-size: .8rem;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(37,64,94,.65);
      text-align: center;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding-top: 65px; }
      .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      .steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 650px) {
      .container { width: min(100% - 26px, 1180px); }
      .nav-links { display: none; }
      .hero { gap: 30px; }
      .tier { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .grid, .steps, .checklist { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      section { padding: 50px 0; }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
<header>
  <nav class="container">
    <a class="brand" href="#inicio">
      <span class="brand-mark">&gt;_</span>
      <span>DevOps AWS Lab</span>
    </a>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#arquitectura">Arquitectura</a>
      <a href="#infra">Infraestructura</a>
      <a href="#ansible">Ansible</a>
      <a href="#checklist">Checklist</a>
    </div>
  </nav>
</header>

<main>
  <section class="container hero" id="inicio">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">AWS · Terraform · Ansible</span>
      <h1>Arquitectura<br><span class="gradient">Multi-Tier</span></h1>
      <p>
        Implementación de una plataforma web altamente disponible,
        distribuida en múltiples Availability Zones y automatizada
        mediante Infrastructure as Code y configuración declarativa.
      </p>
      <div class="buttons">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#arquitectura">Ver arquitectura</a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#checklist">Ver criterios</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-card">
      <div class="terminal">
        <div class="terminal-top">~/devops-aws · deployment</div>
        <div class="terminal-body">
          <div><span class="green">$</span> terraform apply</div>
          <div>aws_vpc.main ........ <span class="green">created</span></div>
          <div>aws_subnet.public[0]  <span class="green">created</span></div>
          <div>aws_subnet.public[1]  <span class="green">created</span></div>
          <div>aws_instance.web[0]   <span class="green">created</span></div>
          <div>aws_instance.web[1]   <span class="green">created</span></div>
          <div>aws_instance.app[0]   <span class="green">created</span></div>
          <div>aws_instance.app[1]   <span class="green">created</span></div>
          <br>
          <div><span class="blue">$</span> ansible-playbook site.yml</div>
          <div>web-tier ............. <span class="green">ok</span></div>
          <div>app-tier ............. <span class="green">ok</span></div>
          <br>
          <div><span class="orange">STATUS:</span> infrastructure ready ✓</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="arquitectura">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <span>01 · Diseño</span>
        <h2>Arquitectura de la solución</h2>
        <p>Separación clara entre exposición pública, procesamiento de aplicación y gestión del estado de Terraform.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="architecture">
        <div class="tier tier-web">
          <div class="tier-label">WEB TIER</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Internet → ALB → Web Servers</h3>
            <p>Subredes públicas en al menos dos AZs. Nginx/Apache sirve contenido y recibe únicamente tráfico autorizado.</p>
            <div class="chips">
              <span class="chip">ALB</span>
              <span class="chip">EC2 × 2</span>
              <span class="chip">Public Subnets</span>
              <span class="chip">Nginx</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flow">↓</div>

        <div class="tier tier-app">
          <div class="tier-label">APP TIER</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Web Servers → Application Servers :8080</h3>
            <p>Instancias privadas sin IP pública. El Security Group permite tráfico solamente desde la capa Web.</p>
            <div class="chips">
              <span class="chip">EC2 × 2</span>
              <span class="chip">Private Subnets</span>
              <span class="chip">Node.js / Python</span>
              <span class="chip">Port 8080</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flow">↓</div>

        <div class="tier tier-state">
          <div class="tier-label">STATE</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Terraform Remote State</h3>
            <p>S3 conserva el estado remoto. El mecanismo de locking evita operaciones concurrentes sobre el mismo state.</p>
            <div class="chips">
              <span class="chip">S3</span>
              <span class="chip">State Versioning</span>
              <span class="chip">State Locking</span>
              <span class="chip">IAM</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="infra">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <span>02 · Terraform</span>
        <h2>Infraestructura como código</h2>
        <p>Recursos declarativos y etiquetados para permitir automatización, descubrimiento dinámico y alta disponibilidad.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid">
        <article class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">VPC</div>
          <h3>Red multi-AZ</h3>
          <p>VPC con subredes públicas y privadas distribuidas en dos o más Availability Zones.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">SG</div>
          <h3>Security Groups</h3>
          <p>Reglas restrictivas: Internet → Web y Web → App:8080. La capa privada no se expone directamente.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">EC2</div>
          <h3>Compute</h3>
          <p>Dos Web Servers y dos Application Servers utilizando count o for_each para facilitar HA.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">LB</div>
          <h3>Application Load Balancer</h3>
          <p>Entrada pública y distribución de solicitudes hacia los Web Servers mediante target groups y health checks.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">TAG</div>
          <h3>Tags para Ansible</h3>
          <p>Etiquetas como Tier=Web y Tier=App para que el inventario dinámico descubra automáticamente las instancias.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">S3</div>
          <h3>Remote State</h3>
          <p>State remoto, versionado y protegido contra operaciones concurrentes mediante locking.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="ansible">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <span>03 · Ansible</span>
        <h2>Configuración automatizada</h2>
        <p>El inventario dinámico consulta AWS y separa automáticamente los servidores por su metadata.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="steps">
        <article class="step">
          <div class="step-number">01</div>
          <h3>Discover</h3>
          <p>aws_ec2 descubre instancias mediante tags.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="step">
          <div class="step-number">02</div>
          <h3>Web Tier</h3>
          <p>Instala y configura Nginx o Apache.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="step">
          <div class="step-number">03</div>
          <h3>Static Page</h3>
          <p>Despliega este index.html como contenido web.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="step">
          <div class="step-number">04</div>
          <h3>App Tier</h3>
          <p>Instala Node.js/Python y ejecuta la aplicación.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="step">
          <div class="step-number">05</div>
          <h3>Idempotency</h3>
          <p>Playbooks repetibles, handlers y servicios habilitados.</p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div style="height:18px"></div>

      <div class="code">
        <span class="green">#</span> Ejemplo de flujo<br>
        <span class="blue">$</span> ansible-inventory -i aws_ec2.yml --graph<br>
        <span class="blue">$</span> ansible-playbook -i aws_ec2.yml web.yml<br>
        <span class="blue">$</span> ansible-playbook -i aws_ec2.yml app.yml<br>
        <span class="green">✓</span> Web tier configured<br>
        <span class="green">✓</span> App tier configured<br>
        <span class="green">✓</span> Services enabled and running
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="checklist">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <span>04 · Evaluación</span>
        <h2>Definition of Done</h2>
        <p>Checklist visual para demostrar que el desafío cumple sus objetivos.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="checklist">
        <div class="check">
          <span class="check-mark">✓</span>
          <div><strong>Terraform Apply</strong><small>La infraestructura se provisiona sin errores.</small></div>
        </div>
        <div class="check">
          <span class="check-mark">✓</span>
          <div><strong>Remote State</strong><small>El terraform.tfstate se almacena remotamente.</small></div>
        </div>
        <div class="check">
          <span class="check-mark">✓</span>
          <div><strong>State Locking</strong><small>Se evita la escritura concurrente del estado.</small></div>
        </div>
        <div class="check">
          <span class="check-mark">✓</span>
          <div><strong>Multi-AZ</strong><small>Web y App se distribuyen entre Availability Zones.</small></div>
        </div>
        <div class="check">
          <span class="check-mark">✓</span>
          <div><strong>Private App Tier</strong><small>Los Application Servers no tienen IP pública.</small></div>
        </div>
        <div class="check">
          <span class="check-mark">✓</span>
          <div><strong>Dynamic Inventory</strong><small>Ansible descubre EC2 mediante tags de AWS.</small></div>
        </div>
        <div class="check">
          <span class="check-mark">✓</span>
          <div><strong>Health Checks</strong><small>El tráfico se dirige hacia targets saludables.</small></div>
        </div>
        <div class="check">
          <span class="check-mark">✓</span>
          <div><strong>Terraform Destroy</strong><small>Todos los recursos se pueden eliminar limpiamente.</small></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<footer>
  <div class="container">
    DevOps · AWS Multi-Tier Architecture · Terraform + Ansible
  </div>
</footer>
</body>
</html>